      "content": "wait, levothyroxine? i thought that was for when your thyroid is underactive, not overactive. and i'm a bit confused because you're saying i should just take it to balance things out... how exactly does taking more thyroid hormone help if my thyroid is already working too hard? also, do i need to worry about my heart rate getting even higher if i do that?",
